    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0030",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s02-p091-03990-s003",
      "sentenceText": "So what is the key to a psychologically rich aesthetic experience?",
      "sentenceSha256": "4d2595c1881e745ae59c80ab6f4928395a2e9b3bbba848ec3a70f668bdcd0f14",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s02-p091-03990-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "ce05cc354593001aae55bc71cb2088535d655900ad5664e3c3bab0b06bb2f100",
      "passageSha256": "09eea7d5d2178957418e22fa470a2bc6479ea2a610efecc0896ba9296bee270d",
      "pdfPages": [
        91
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0031",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s02-p091-03990-s005",
      "sentenceText": "They have to be transported to the narrative world and experience the events in the story as if they were in them themselves.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d698cf0e0ce5f1a31b85deb6ea9e8b1566873a911b3173e26afd558b440b6546",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s02-p091-03990-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "0d2a74340d94e3f66a9e974c828475e3745ac2f3da9b35991d84374b519e6811",
      "passageSha256": "9ac3896152cead98e3972d5a4fc6a408246ad311d9c63d4f08888205cff9ccbc",
      "pdfPages": [
        91
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0032",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s02-p091-03990-s008",
      "sentenceText": "There have been many times when I watched a movie over the weekend, only to forget the plot after just a few days.",
      "sentenceSha256": "366bb37f0735de1fd3bd171bad853e3e318662fa5b06d34cf0e5888bf2785ae3",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s02-p091-03990-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "0d2a74340d94e3f66a9e974c828475e3745ac2f3da9b35991d84374b519e6811",
      "passageSha256": "9ac3896152cead98e3972d5a4fc6a408246ad311d9c63d4f08888205cff9ccbc",
      "pdfPages": [
        91
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s02-p091-03990-s009",
      "sentenceText": "In order for the reading or watching experience to be rich, it has to remain vivid in one’s memory.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4ee7c24669134147a97e14d24d39a3a6a884ede34ea5110ab00d764b5c020f66",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s02-p091-03990-r009-010",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "0f5ba1a4866f63a4850290d1787e33eb1936af7f1effd3aa0bb1860fc13c3625",
      "passageSha256": "908d9fe22d46324d1e81ab10278039b504c5f6ba1f231996915b631764e3b048",
      "pdfPages": [
        91
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s02-p092-00750-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Some sensation-seekers go all over the world only to find that these diverse experiences do not seem to add up to a satisfying life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1f3718a3034773450a49ce9b5345990972e95edb1cb6b41c461d7d4dba278531",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s02-p092-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "62354113a9a9b612c186a4cff930e7bac32ba8baaa2066dd4d5e79896cfc0c66",
      "passageSha256": "21102de157df4bc6e1776f71d5d7696d380764fc80526a3580e9f01704ace56f",
      "pdfPages": [
        92
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s02-p092-00750-s003",
      "sentenceText": "They constantly need new experiences.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c468785c58293084ebed3073a56f22535cb7b8197d45a2a45ff1ecfeb0c497e3",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s02-p092-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c09-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "62354113a9a9b612c186a4cff930e7bac32ba8baaa2066dd4d5e79896cfc0c66",
      "passageSha256": "21102de157df4bc6e1776f71d5d7696d380764fc80526a3580e9f01704ace56f",
      "pdfPages": [
        92
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c09-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c09-s02-p092-00750-s006",
      "sentenceText": "The memory is crucial.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8665d36f92e4b530cd89c6ad652b5feb37210f309003a02b09f1febe71e77550",
      "readingUnitId": "c09-s02-p092-00750-r005-006",
